    ["<InvHighlight>2号和3号子弹</>是真的。\n\n欲念使者增加了<InvHighlight>真弹的数量</>，使第一次选择命中真弹的概率达到<InvHighlight>三分之二</>。\n\n当一颗真弹被排除后，重新选择的胜率反而降至<InvHighlight>二分之一</>。因此，<InvHighlight>坚持原本的选择</>更为有利。\n\n概率只能揭示更有利的选择，并不能决定最终结果。若实际结果与判断不符，也只是<InvHighlight>运气造成的偶然</>。"] = "<InvHighlight>Bullet No. 2 and No. 3</> are real. \n\nThe Messenger of Desire increased the <InvHighlight>number of real bullets</>, making the probability of hitting a real bullet on the first choice reach <InvHighlight>two-thirds</>. \n\nWhen a real bullet is excluded, the win rate of choosing again actually drops to <InvHighlight>one-half</>. Therefore, <InvHighlight>sticking to the original choice</> is more advantageous. \n\nProbability can only reveal the more advantageous choice; it cannot determine the final result. If the actual result does not match the judgment, it is merely <InvHighlight>an accident caused by luck</>.",
